display.text:
/* mtd-pricing fallback: the mobile bleed clamp.
 *
 * The price cards are two fixed-width flex items (358px and 432px at a 390px
 * viewport, measured) inside a 358px row — 790px of card in a 358px box. The
 * export does not scroll or clip them, so the page itself scrolls sideways by
 * 22px at 390 (measured: scrollWidth 412 vs clientWidth 390) and the second
 * card is reachable only by dragging the whole document.
 *
 * A page-wide horizontal scroll is not shippable above the 360px floor, so the
 * stripe clips instead: the second card stays cut exactly where the export
 * cuts it, and the document no longer moves. `clip` rather than `hidden`
 * because a scroll container would add wheel/touch scrolling inside a section
 * that has no arrows, dots or scrollbar — the export has no such control on the
 * price row (unlike §8/§9, which do have a slider).
 *
 * Scoped to the pricing fragment's own pattern id; both the section stripe and
 * the nested card stripe carry it, and no other component does.
 */
@media (max-width: 767px) {
  [data-pattern-id='PS01'] {
    overflow-x: clip;
  }
}

/* THEME (light): the section's ground is its own glow artwork — a dark picture
 * that the export paints over a DARK ground. The bundle's light theme repaints
 * the stripe white underneath that picture, and the cards (the export's
 * translucent #1B1B1B at 70%) then composite to mid grey, which drops the card
 * ink below the contrast bar (the green promo line at 3.23:1, the micro-text at
 * 3.76:1). The section keeps the shipped dark ground in both themes: the
 * artwork is the section, not the theme.
 *
 * Value: the kit's `Theme/Primary & Background/White or Black` in its DARK mode
 * (#000) — the ground the export ships. Ledger row: docs/TOKENS.md.
 */
.theme-light [data-pattern-id='PS01'] {
  background-color: #000;
}

/* The footnote sits on that dark ground, so it keeps the shipped dark ink in
 * the light theme too: the bundle's light ink (rgba(0,0,0,0.65) on the note,
 * jade on the link) would sit on black at 1:1 and 4.23:1. Values: the kit's
 * `Theme/Text/text secondary color` and `text primary color` in their DARK
 * modes — docs/TOKENS.md.
 */
.theme-light [data-pattern-id='PS01'] .content-spot--footnotes p {
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
}

.theme-light [data-pattern-id='PS01'] .content-spot--footnotes a {
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
}

/* CTA row: layout for the pricing buttons. */
.mtd-pricing-cta.button--secondary {
  min-height: 48px;
  padding: 0 24px;
}

.button--secondary:hover {
  background-color: #0a5c36;
  color: #fff;
}

.button--secondary:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid #f00;
}

.product-card-cta-tertiary-alt:active {
  transform: scale(0.97);
}

.button-tertiary:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}

.button-tertiary {
  min-height: 44px;
}

